        -:  510:/**
        -:  511: * An orthogonal dimension is like an aligned dimension, but the extension lines are locked to the
        -:  512: * X or Y axes, and the measurement is only taken in the X or Y direction.
        -:  513: */
        -:  514:class PCB_DIM_ORTHOGONAL : public PCB_DIM_ALIGNED
